## Interface: 16001
## Title: Theme
## Notes: A flat look, dark solid backgrounds with a muted gold line, for the chat windows, the experience and reputation bars, the action bars, the micro menu and bag bar, and tooltips, with the bottom bars lined up in one Edit Mode layout, and a level badge on every unit frame.
## Version: 0.1.0
## Dependencies: Everlook, EverlookPreferences, EverlookQA
## Group: Everlook
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\Everlook\assets\logo.tga

